  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### CAPIUM 365: Bringing in transactions with a Bank Feed\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 9 Oct, 2025 at 10:19 AM\n\n\t\tConnect your bank accounts directly to Capium to automatically pull transactions into the Books section. Bank feeds are free and unlimited with Capium 365.\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Client > Bank Feeds > \n\nSteps:\n\nGo to Client > Bank Feeds.\n\nClick \"+ Add New Account\".\n\nSelect your banking provider from the list.\n\nClick \"Allow\" and follow the prompts to connect your account.\n\nOnce connected, your bank transactions will start appearing automatically.\n\nSee screenshot below for reference:\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
